WEBVTT

00:00:15.390 --> 00:00:19.040
<b>tsukinuketa aoi sora</b>

00:00:15.390 --> 00:00:19.040
<b>The blue sky has broken through</b>

00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:22.040
<b>saa dekakeyou</b>

00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:22.040
<b>Come, let's go out</b>

00:00:22.040 --> 00:00:28.880
<b>itsumo no namikimichi jitensha wo koideku</b>

00:00:22.040 --> 00:00:28.880
<b>Riding my bike through the usual avenue</b>

00:00:29.630 --> 00:00:33.550
<b>ima sugu ni aitai yo</b>

00:00:29.630 --> 00:00:33.550
<b>"I want to meet you now."</b>

00:00:33.550 --> 00:00:36.800
<b>omoi ga kaze wo kiri</b>

00:00:33.550 --> 00:00:36.800
<b>That thought is blown away by the wind,</b>

00:00:36.800 --> 00:00:44.770
<b>kimi e to hakondeku tegami ni natte</b>

00:00:36.800 --> 00:00:44.770
<b>and becomes a letter being carried to you</b>

00:00:44.770 --> 00:00:52.360
<b>koko kara hajimaru monogatari fly!</b>

00:00:44.770 --> 00:00:52.360
<b>The story that starts from here... Fly!</b>

00:00:52.360 --> 00:00:59.660
<b>kawariyuku kisetsu ga ashioto wo tatetemo</b>

00:00:52.360 --> 00:00:59.660
<b>Even if the changing seasons walk on with loud footsteps,</b>

00:00:59.660 --> 00:01:06.500
<b>sou kawaranai suki to iu tsubasa</b>

00:00:59.660 --> 00:01:06.500
<b>the wings of love won't change</b>

00:01:07.130 --> 00:01:14.510
<b>dokomade mo tondeke oozora takaku</b>

00:01:07.130 --> 00:01:14.510
<b>Fly far away, high into the sky</b>

00:01:14.510 --> 00:01:20.720
<b>koi no tenki yohou hare nochi hare ni nare</b>

00:01:14.510 --> 00:01:20.720
<b>May the weather forecast of love be sunny and clear forever</b>

00:01:21.640 --> 00:01:28.400
<b>ashita mo asatte mo</b>

00:01:21.640 --> 00:01:28.400
<b>Tomorrow and the day after tomorrow</b>

00:01:31.270 --> 00:01:34.280
Dare ga sukuware dare ga sukuwarenaika wa—

00:01:34.190 --> 00:01:39.740
<b>Episode 2    Please god</b>

00:01:34.280 --> 00:01:36.150
kami nomizo shiru koto da.

00:01:36.490 --> 00:01:37.950
Let's try translating this sentence.

00:01:37.950 --> 00:01:39.910
Let's see—

00:01:40.530 --> 00:01:41.490
God!

00:01:43.620 --> 00:01:44.410
Yes.

00:01:49.250 --> 00:01:52.630
Only god knows—

00:01:53.170 --> 00:01:56.970
who— will not be saved—

00:01:56.970 --> 00:01:59.340
You don't have to be so nervous.

00:02:01.510 --> 00:02:04.140
She hasn't changed a bit, even after becoming a god!

00:02:10.150 --> 00:02:11.360
Hey, little god!

00:02:12.270 --> 00:02:14.400
Can I borrow your gym clothes?

00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:15.690
What?

00:02:16.360 --> 00:02:18.400
I just washed them.

00:02:20.410 --> 00:02:22.370
<b>Thermite reaction
Making iron from aluminium</b>

00:02:24.830 --> 00:02:26.450
Are you all right?

00:02:25.660 --> 00:02:27.710
This god is so clumsy.

00:02:33.460 --> 00:02:35.340
They are totally looking down on her.

00:02:36.340 --> 00:02:37.720
Do you think so?

00:02:37.720 --> 00:02:40.340
I think everything is the same as before.

00:02:40.760 --> 00:02:42.510
It's not good that it's the same.

00:02:43.640 --> 00:02:45.640
She is a god now.

00:02:48.520 --> 00:02:50.480
Why are they looking down on you?

00:02:51.100 --> 00:02:55.610
Because you haven't done anything god-like for them.

00:02:57.530 --> 00:02:59.570
Therefore, I want you to look at this plan.

00:02:59.990 --> 00:03:01.200
What is this?

00:03:01.860 --> 00:03:03.570
We are going to have a festival.

00:03:03.570 --> 00:03:07.080
I want to hold it at least once a year 
and make it our famous local event.

00:03:07.080 --> 00:03:11.040
My goal is to make it like "Carnival" in Rio 
de Janeiro, or Danjiri festival in Kishiwada!

00:03:11.370 --> 00:03:13.390
I don't like showy things.

00:03:13.390 --> 00:03:16.050
Wouldn't you get in trouble 
if you made your own festival?

00:03:16.050 --> 00:03:18.300
It's all for Yurie.

00:03:19.010 --> 00:03:22.800
The teacher can write her qualification 
as "god" on her official transcript.

00:03:23.800 --> 00:03:25.510
It'll be an advantage for your entrance exam.

00:03:26.720 --> 00:03:28.680
Of course not!

00:03:30.180 --> 00:03:32.030
Come to my place after school.

00:03:32.030 --> 00:03:33.650
There's something I want to do.

00:03:53.250 --> 00:03:55.130
I'm so tired—

00:03:55.130 --> 00:03:58.840
How many more times do 
we have to climb those steps?

00:03:59.460 --> 00:04:01.010
Then, do you want to live here?

00:04:02.130 --> 00:04:04.090
It might be better.

00:04:04.970 --> 00:04:07.760
But, it won't make any difference.

00:04:12.140 --> 00:04:13.480
Oh, that's right.

00:04:31.700 --> 00:04:33.080
Good afternoon.

00:04:33.870 --> 00:04:34.960
Welcome home.

00:04:34.960 --> 00:04:36.040
We were waiting for you.

00:04:36.380 --> 00:04:37.950
Can you open up the main shrine?

00:04:37.950 --> 00:04:40.130
We want to salute Yashima-sama.

00:04:43.470 --> 00:04:44.550
Why?

00:04:45.430 --> 00:04:48.010
Yurie will become our exclusive god.

00:04:48.010 --> 00:04:48.590
What?

00:04:48.590 --> 00:04:50.310
When did we decide that?

00:04:51.720 --> 00:04:53.640
Oh, hello.

00:04:54.100 --> 00:04:55.100
Hello.

00:05:06.570 --> 00:05:07.820
Please come out.

00:05:17.790 --> 00:05:20.290
Please come out.

00:05:21.880 --> 00:05:22.760
Did he come out?

00:05:23.880 --> 00:05:25.170
Why are you asking that?

00:05:25.170 --> 00:05:26.760
Because, I can't tell.

00:05:27.720 --> 00:05:28.640
Do you feel anything?

00:05:30.930 --> 00:05:31.850
Nothing.

00:05:32.350 --> 00:05:33.560
It's strange.

00:05:35.310 --> 00:05:36.350
I'm sorry.

00:05:36.730 --> 00:05:39.730
Yashima-sama hasn't been here in 3 months.

00:05:41.070 --> 00:05:42.190
What did you say?!

00:05:42.860 --> 00:05:45.440
He suddenly disappeared.

00:05:45.860 --> 00:05:47.410
It seems like he ran away from here.

00:05:48.200 --> 00:05:50.990
But, I couldn't tell you that.

00:05:50.990 --> 00:05:52.160
Why?!

00:05:53.120 --> 00:05:56.750
I thought that it'd hurt father's feelings.

00:06:02.840 --> 00:06:03.920
I see—

00:06:13.930 --> 00:06:15.810
All right. Actually this is good timing.

00:06:16.640 --> 00:06:19.190
I'm going to retire as chief priest starting today.

00:06:20.900 --> 00:06:23.360
I haven't been suited to being 
chief priest from the beginning.

00:06:24.190 --> 00:06:28.110
You two can run this place the way you want to.

00:06:28.900 --> 00:06:31.820
I'm going to focus on farming.

00:06:31.820 --> 00:06:34.990
If you have a problem with 
vegetables, then come and ask me.

00:06:41.920 --> 00:06:43.380
What's going on?

00:06:45.500 --> 00:06:49.130
As he said, his talents don't 
lie in being the chief priest.

00:06:49.130 --> 00:06:52.720
The number of visitors here has been 
declining rapidly and now we are deep in debt.

00:06:53.850 --> 00:06:56.810
Even our furniture is being claimed by the bank.

00:06:57.310 --> 00:06:58.730
I see.

00:06:59.730 --> 00:07:02.100
But, he grows such delicious vegetables.

00:07:02.480 --> 00:07:03.610
That's right.

00:07:03.980 --> 00:07:06.200
But this is not a vegetable store.

00:07:06.200 --> 00:07:09.150
We must work hard to pay off our debt.

00:07:10.400 --> 00:07:14.740
Is there anything I can do to help you guys?

00:07:14.740 --> 00:07:16.620
Sure! A lot!

00:07:18.620 --> 00:07:20.460
Copy these characters on here?

00:07:20.460 --> 00:07:21.210
Yes.

00:07:22.330 --> 00:07:23.710
Please don't make a mistake.

00:07:24.130 --> 00:07:24.840
Yes.

00:07:24.840 --> 00:07:27.210
Anyhow, let's find Yashima-sama.

00:07:28.010 --> 00:07:30.130
Don't be so rough on him.

00:07:30.880 --> 00:07:34.100
I think he already went to some other town.

00:07:36.100 --> 00:07:37.930
He doesn't have the guts to do that.

00:07:37.930 --> 00:07:42.140
He is just a local god trying 
to act like a runaway kid.

00:07:43.810 --> 00:07:45.310
How do you know that?

00:07:45.310 --> 00:07:47.570
I used to talk to him when I was a kid.

00:07:49.280 --> 00:07:52.490
Even now, Yashima-sama still thinks about you, sis?

00:07:56.080 --> 00:07:57.330
I did it!

00:07:58.870 --> 00:07:59.790
How is it?

00:08:00.200 --> 00:08:02.420
You have an aureole!

00:08:05.540 --> 00:08:06.750
Looks good!

00:08:06.750 --> 00:08:09.590
But, it should actually change your shape as well.

00:08:09.590 --> 00:08:10.620
Why is it not changing?

00:08:10.620 --> 00:08:11.790
Maybe because I'm new?

00:08:11.790 --> 00:08:13.720
No, because your handwriting is bad.

00:08:25.690 --> 00:08:27.270
Yashima-sama?

00:08:27.980 --> 00:08:29.900
Did you see him recently?

00:08:31.190 --> 00:08:32.360
I see.

00:08:32.360 --> 00:08:35.200
Thank you for your help.

00:08:33.400 --> 00:08:37.530
I didn't realize the town looked like this.

00:08:35.200 --> 00:08:37.530
Let me know if you get any information.

00:08:37.530 --> 00:08:39.790
Yeah, leave it to me.

00:08:37.530 --> 00:08:39.790
I also just realized that.

00:08:43.250 --> 00:08:44.000
Mitsue-chan!

00:08:44.000 --> 00:08:45.370
What are you doing?

00:08:45.370 --> 00:08:47.080
Are you all right?

00:08:47.670 --> 00:08:50.880
Don't be afraid. They are just teasing you.

00:08:51.710 --> 00:08:53.880
Let's split up here.

00:09:37.180 --> 00:09:38.890
We couldn't find him.

00:09:38.890 --> 00:09:41.260
Where could he be, really?

00:09:42.180 --> 00:09:43.430
What are we going to do?

00:09:44.270 --> 00:09:45.600
Don't worry.

00:09:46.140 --> 00:09:48.350
We can find him.

00:09:51.570 --> 00:09:52.650
Yes.

00:10:12.000 --> 00:10:14.210
We caught the big one, bro!

00:10:21.260 --> 00:10:22.850
What are you doing?

00:10:22.850 --> 00:10:25.430
Aren't you calling for a typhoon today?

00:10:26.310 --> 00:10:27.400
Sorry.

00:10:27.400 --> 00:10:30.190
I'm looking for someone today.

00:10:30.980 --> 00:10:31.690
Excuse me!

00:10:32.520 --> 00:10:35.690
Do you know any place where gods convene?

00:10:37.860 --> 00:10:40.450
Hey, old man, do you know?

00:10:41.200 --> 00:10:49.670
I think there's an entrance on top of that mountain.

00:11:03.220 --> 00:11:04.310
This is—

00:11:06.520 --> 00:11:07.390
Probably—

00:11:10.730 --> 00:11:13.940
Restricted to members only, huh?

00:11:20.650 --> 00:11:21.860
Member?

00:11:21.860 --> 00:11:23.620
Good luck, Yurie.

00:11:33.210 --> 00:11:34.170
Miko-chan.

00:11:34.670 --> 00:11:36.710
I'll be sure to find him.

00:11:38.800 --> 00:11:39.670
Yes.

00:11:44.510 --> 00:11:45.600
Be careful.

00:11:50.560 --> 00:11:52.100
If you encounter any dangerous situations—

00:11:52.100 --> 00:11:52.940
If I—

00:11:55.400 --> 00:11:56.400
Try harder!

00:11:58.440 --> 00:11:59.400
I will!

00:12:22.380 --> 00:12:23.430
Oops!

00:12:40.940 --> 00:12:42.700
The world of the gods?

00:12:45.240 --> 00:12:46.620
Hey!

00:12:48.950 --> 00:12:50.370
Do you need a ride?

00:12:54.210 --> 00:12:55.420
Please.

00:12:56.540 --> 00:12:59.630
Yashima-sama, I haven't seen him recently.

00:13:00.460 --> 00:13:01.550
I see.

00:13:02.670 --> 00:13:05.010
Well, he might be around.

00:13:05.800 --> 00:13:08.600
It's not bad to stick around and slowly look for him.

00:13:09.220 --> 00:13:11.770
But, people are waiting for me.

00:13:11.770 --> 00:13:12.840
I see.

00:13:15.100 --> 00:13:16.440
Lower your head a little.

00:13:18.400 --> 00:13:19.770
Here we go.

00:13:42.710 --> 00:13:45.470
Lately I don't get a lot of work.

00:13:45.470 --> 00:13:48.510
Lord VHD, your situation is much better.

00:13:48.510 --> 00:13:51.140
I didn't even have a chance to work.

00:13:51.510 --> 00:13:52.590
Calm down.

00:13:52.590 --> 00:13:54.520
Technology changes over time.

00:13:54.930 --> 00:13:57.530
Laser, it'll happen to you soon!

00:13:57.530 --> 00:13:58.690
Excuse me—

00:14:01.070 --> 00:14:04.490
Is Yashima-sama here?

00:14:06.200 --> 00:14:07.910
What kind of god is he?

00:14:10.320 --> 00:14:11.410
Well—

00:14:12.160 --> 00:14:15.830
You know, it's not that we always know everybody.

00:14:16.160 --> 00:14:17.500
Is that so?

00:14:17.500 --> 00:14:21.210
Yes! There are so many gods.

00:14:21.960 --> 00:14:23.130
So many?

00:14:23.130 --> 00:14:24.710
How many gods are there?

00:14:25.050 --> 00:14:28.590
About the same amount as 
things created in the universe.

00:14:29.090 --> 00:14:32.140
There are so many things created in the universe.

00:14:32.140 --> 00:14:33.390
That's right.

00:14:34.470 --> 00:14:37.180
So, young girl, what kind of god are you?

00:14:37.730 --> 00:14:39.810
That's what I don't know.

00:14:41.060 --> 00:14:42.900
You must be having a hard time.

00:15:05.960 --> 00:15:08.170
This is so calming.

00:15:10.510 --> 00:15:12.550
I didn't know there was a temple here.

00:15:22.770 --> 00:15:24.590
This isn't calming.

00:15:24.590 --> 00:15:27.280
It's been like this for 3 months now.

00:15:27.780 --> 00:15:29.190
3 months?

00:15:44.000 --> 00:15:45.750
That's enough.

00:15:47.130 --> 00:15:48.130
Sorry—

00:15:48.760 --> 00:15:52.720
I couldn't suppress the hot beat inside of me.

00:15:52.720 --> 00:15:54.800
You have to straighten yourself out.

00:15:56.680 --> 00:15:57.870
Excuse me.

00:15:58.490 --> 00:16:00.730
Are you Yashima-sama?

00:16:02.060 --> 00:16:03.000
Who is that?

00:16:03.000 --> 00:16:04.810
She's full of divinity.

00:16:04.810 --> 00:16:06.440
Is she your groupie?

00:16:06.440 --> 00:16:07.650
I don't know.

00:16:08.320 --> 00:16:10.570
Don't be suspicious of me.

00:16:10.570 --> 00:16:11.580
I'm—

00:16:12.350 --> 00:16:13.530
Well—

00:16:14.410 --> 00:16:15.700
I'm a god.

00:16:16.490 --> 00:16:17.660
I just started.

00:16:19.370 --> 00:16:21.620
It seems like the charm stopped.

00:16:23.080 --> 00:16:26.500
She has to work on her calligraphy.

00:16:28.210 --> 00:16:32.590
Anyhow, don't overuse her.

00:16:32.590 --> 00:16:35.300
You know, she is quite simple-minded.

00:16:37.850 --> 00:16:38.680
A mosquito.

00:16:45.940 --> 00:16:47.110
You're right.

00:16:50.780 --> 00:16:51.860
A band?

00:16:51.860 --> 00:16:52.570
Yes.

00:16:53.400 --> 00:16:56.030
You mean like a rock band?

00:16:56.410 --> 00:16:57.320
Yes.

00:16:57.320 --> 00:17:01.080
Well, I might also want to play punk.

00:17:01.080 --> 00:17:06.540
I saw Benzaiten-sama's tour this 
past New Year and was inspired.

00:17:07.380 --> 00:17:10.210
I really wanted to see my potential.

00:17:12.920 --> 00:17:16.720
I thought I'd go up to Tokyo.

00:17:17.550 --> 00:17:21.470
But I'm kind of scared to go alone, 
so I'm gathering band members here.

00:17:22.930 --> 00:17:25.440
Can't you do that at Matsuri-chan's place?

00:17:27.270 --> 00:17:29.520
I wanted to get out of there.

00:17:35.030 --> 00:17:37.860
I wanted to embark on a whole new world.

00:17:38.870 --> 00:17:44.450
Otherwise, I'll just end up as a rural area's local god.

00:17:47.500 --> 00:17:50.540
Miko-chan was worried about you.

00:17:51.880 --> 00:17:54.090
Was she—?

00:17:55.880 --> 00:18:00.510
I don't understand your feelings 
because they're so complicated.

00:18:01.970 --> 00:18:05.850
And I like that town.

00:18:09.230 --> 00:18:16.240
But I don't think you should 
run away without telling anyone.

00:18:16.610 --> 00:18:19.410
Miko-chan is having a hard time, too.

00:18:20.070 --> 00:18:26.160
And people are visiting the shrine 
because they think you are there.

00:18:26.790 --> 00:18:31.460
I don't think it's right to run 
away and leave them like that.

00:18:34.250 --> 00:18:37.920
I'm sorry! I shouldn't preach to a god like this!

00:18:38.630 --> 00:18:41.930
You are also a god, Yurie-sama.

00:18:43.600 --> 00:18:47.140
I'm just a middle school girl and I just became a god.

00:18:47.890 --> 00:18:49.900
I don't deserve to be called a god.

00:18:49.900 --> 00:18:55.530
You have much stronger power than I.

00:18:55.900 --> 00:18:58.570
And you have a very pure heart too.

00:18:59.150 --> 00:19:01.620
Let me call you Yurie-sama.

00:19:03.370 --> 00:19:05.910
So, would you come back?

00:19:06.910 --> 00:19:09.540
Yes, I'd be happy to.

00:19:12.290 --> 00:19:13.670
I'm so glad!

00:19:15.170 --> 00:19:16.460
That's the best thing.

00:19:18.340 --> 00:19:20.930
That town suits you well.

00:19:20.930 --> 00:19:23.800
And I'm sorry to say, you don't have any talent at all.

00:19:24.720 --> 00:19:27.220
I can still play in a local band.

00:19:27.220 --> 00:19:28.850
You still haven't given up?!

00:19:28.850 --> 00:19:30.570
Of course not.

00:19:30.570 --> 00:19:32.310
My dream is to sign a major label.

00:19:32.310 --> 00:19:33.810
I see. I see.

00:19:51.830 --> 00:19:52.960
I'm back.

00:19:53.500 --> 00:19:54.750
Welcome back.

00:19:54.750 --> 00:19:55.920
How did it go?

00:20:09.980 --> 00:20:11.520
Is he back?

00:20:11.980 --> 00:20:13.560
Yes, indeed.

00:20:20.940 --> 00:20:22.110
I'm so glad.

00:20:23.110 --> 00:20:24.490
I'm sorry.

00:20:26.200 --> 00:20:29.580
I'm really glad.

00:20:34.210 --> 00:20:35.750
I'm so sorry.

00:20:39.550 --> 00:20:41.010
What is he saying?

00:20:42.300 --> 00:20:43.590
He's apologizing.

00:20:44.340 --> 00:20:45.300
I see.

00:20:48.430 --> 00:20:50.930
Hey, doesn't he want to apologize to me?

00:20:52.560 --> 00:20:54.270
You can't see him anyway.

00:20:54.600 --> 00:20:56.150
It's the thought that counts.

00:20:56.610 --> 00:20:57.900
Yeah?

00:21:03.860 --> 00:21:07.070
Well, excuse me for a moment.

00:21:14.120 --> 00:21:15.920
Long time no see.

00:21:15.920 --> 00:21:16.680
What?

00:21:16.680 --> 00:21:18.280
Yashima-sama?

00:21:18.280 --> 00:21:19.380
Really?

00:21:19.380 --> 00:21:20.340
Yes.

00:21:21.250 --> 00:21:22.880
I haven't seen you for a long time!

00:21:22.880 --> 00:21:26.300
I'm really sorry that I caused this trouble.

00:21:26.300 --> 00:21:28.050
It's all right. I forgive you.

00:21:28.050 --> 00:21:29.180
I'm really sorry.

00:21:29.180 --> 00:21:31.600
I kinda feel good.

00:21:35.350 --> 00:21:37.650
Sign: Yurie-chan Festival

00:21:59.380 --> 00:22:01.500
Big prize!

00:22:01.500 --> 00:22:03.920
Cotton candy!

00:22:05.130 --> 00:22:07.800
Nothing interesting ever happens to me.

00:22:07.800 --> 00:22:09.300
Shijou-san!

00:22:12.220 --> 00:22:14.180
I have a favor to ask you!

00:22:14.810 --> 00:22:17.140
Just greet people, okay?

00:22:17.140 --> 00:22:19.350
Well, then, I'll call you after the opening act ends.

00:22:19.350 --> 00:22:20.730
Yes.

00:22:22.020 --> 00:22:24.030
I was so embarrassed.

00:22:28.570 --> 00:22:30.700
Excuse me, but don't bounce near here.

00:22:32.830 --> 00:22:35.660
Ninomiya-kun, why are you here?

00:22:37.660 --> 00:22:38.870
Who are you?

00:22:40.500 --> 00:22:42.840
Hitotsubashi Yurie.

00:22:43.630 --> 00:22:46.090
Sign: Yurie-chan banana

00:22:43.920 --> 00:22:46.090
Oh, it's you.

00:22:52.850 --> 00:22:54.810
What are you doing?

00:22:55.430 --> 00:22:56.810
Working.

00:22:56.810 --> 00:22:59.020
Matsuri's shrine often asks me to write.

00:22:59.810 --> 00:23:01.270
I see.

00:23:04.570 --> 00:23:05.900
Kenji-kun—

00:23:08.900 --> 00:23:11.240
Err, I mean—

00:23:14.620 --> 00:23:19.080
Ninomiya-kun, do you believe that I'm a god?

00:23:19.080 --> 00:23:21.420
Aren't you one?

00:23:22.040 --> 00:23:22.730
Yes.

00:23:23.260 --> 00:23:24.590
Officially.

00:23:24.590 --> 00:23:26.130
Then, I believe it.

00:23:27.010 --> 00:23:28.420
It doesn't matter anyway.

00:23:31.760 --> 00:23:33.510
But, being a god is great.

00:23:36.770 --> 00:23:40.190
You can make people so happy like this.

00:23:42.650 --> 00:23:44.610
I just picked them today.

00:23:57.990 --> 00:24:00.500
I wish my calligraphy could 
make people happy like that.

00:24:03.790 --> 00:24:06.040
I don't have such—

00:24:11.550 --> 00:24:13.720
Yurie, it's your turn!

00:24:14.300 --> 00:24:16.220
I have to go.

00:24:16.220 --> 00:24:18.970
Then, can you take this with you?

00:24:29.780 --> 00:24:32.240
Sign: Requited love

00:24:30.690 --> 00:24:31.700
Yes.

00:24:40.830 --> 00:24:44.170
Thank you for waiting! Today's main event!

00:24:45.000 --> 00:24:47.590
Our Raifuku Shrine's new face!

00:24:47.590 --> 00:24:50.920
The first middle school girl god in Japan!

00:24:50.920 --> 00:24:53.260
Hitotsubashi Yurie will now greet everyone!

00:25:10.400 --> 00:25:13.400
Please let me announce that I, Hitotsubashi Yurie,

00:25:13.400 --> 00:25:15.160
have become a god.

00:25:16.450 --> 00:25:19.830
I've only recently become a god, but I'll do my best.

00:25:19.830 --> 00:25:23.830
I appreciate everybody here who is supporting me.

00:25:29.000 --> 00:25:31.710
Now, let's have her sing a song.

00:25:31.710 --> 00:25:33.840
The song is "Please God".

00:25:33.840 --> 00:25:34.920
Here we go!

00:25:35.720 --> 00:25:36.840
What?!

00:25:40.490 --> 00:25:46.570
<b>mada mada zenzen owannai last ichijikan no jugyou desu</b>

00:25:40.490 --> 00:25:46.570
<b>The last class of the day never seems to end</b>

00:25:46.570 --> 00:25:51.420
<b>tokei wo chira chira mitemo ichi byou ga nagai ne</b>

00:25:46.570 --> 00:25:51.420
<b>Even if I keep glancing at my watch, a second seems an eternity</b>

00:25:52.460 --> 00:25:58.510
<b>mabushii koutei mieru kimi no hashiru sugata oikake</b>

00:25:52.460 --> 00:25:58.510
<b>In the radiant schoolyard, trailing your running visage,</b>

00:25:58.510 --> 00:26:03.650
<b>houkago love-love date mousou shite bosou chu</b>

00:25:58.510 --> 00:26:03.650
<b>my imagination is running wild about our date after class</b>

00:26:04.530 --> 00:26:07.550
<b>chime no kane koi no signal</b>

00:26:04.530 --> 00:26:07.550
<b>The school chimes ring and it's a signal of love!</b>

00:26:07.550 --> 00:26:10.560
<b>rouka no tobidashi ni wa chuui</b>

00:26:07.550 --> 00:26:10.560
<b>Be careful if you rush out into the hallway!</b>

00:26:10.560 --> 00:26:13.530
<b>kimi no moto e ichiban saki ni</b>

00:26:10.560 --> 00:26:13.530
<b>I dash to see you, first thing!</b>

00:26:13.530 --> 00:26:16.150
<b>issho ni kaerou</b>

00:26:13.530 --> 00:26:16.150
<b>Let's go home together!</b>

00:26:17.130 --> 00:26:23.790
<b>soda aji no ice candy gira gira na ohisama no shita hanbunko</b>

00:26:17.130 --> 00:26:23.790
<b>Sharing a soda-flavored popsicle under the glaring sun</b>

00:26:23.790 --> 00:26:29.830
<b>torokesou na atashi no seishun desu doki doki shichau</b>

00:26:23.790 --> 00:26:29.830
<b>My youth seems to melt with it, it makes my heart beat faster</b>

00:26:29.830 --> 00:26:35.280
<b>kono nanigenai toki wo ima mune ni shimatte</b>

00:26:29.830 --> 00:26:35.280
<b>I'm shutting our casual time in my heart</b>

00:26:35.600 --> 00:26:42.710
<b>asu wa mata kyou yori mo kimi wo suki ni naru no desu</b>

00:26:35.600 --> 00:26:42.710
<b>Tomorrow I will love you even more than today</b>

00:26:46.930 --> 00:27:01.930
<b>Preview</b>

00:26:47.960 --> 00:26:50.580
Everyone! Have you seen our cat, Tama?

00:26:51.080 --> 00:26:53.500
She hasn't come home for 3 days.

00:26:53.500 --> 00:26:55.670
I wonder why she's run away from home.

00:26:56.510 --> 00:27:00.760
Next episode is "I didn't mean it". I'll Chu Chu you!

00:26:56.800 --> 00:27:01.930
<b>I didn't mean it</b>
